{"id":"b1484ba48c364679","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-df-mackey-topology.md","title":"Mackey Topology of a Dual Pair","display":"df-mackey-topology — Mackey Topology of a Dual Pair","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-mackey-topology","aliases":["58-df-mackey-topology","Mackey Topology"],"display":"df-mackey-topology — Mackey Topology of a Dual Pair","depends_on":["[[58-df-dual-pairing]]","[[58-df-zfc-analysis2-locally-convex-space]]","[[58-df-continuous-map]]","[[58-df-linear-map]]","[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-topology]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-mackey-topology"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-mackey-topology</span><span>Mackey Topology</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-mackey-topology — Mackey Topology of a Dual Pair"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2a91ae6809cec03c\" href=\"?note=2a91ae6809cec03c\" title=\"58-df-dual-pairing\">58-df-dual-pairing</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7d71608bc30daeda\" href=\"?note=7d71608bc30daeda\" title=\"58-df-zfc-analysis2-locally-convex-space\">58-df-zfc-analysis2-locally-convex-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3cd1834de4f2efb2\" href=\"?note=3cd1834de4f2efb2\" title=\"58-df-continuous-map\">58-df-continuous-map</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f67456d74b418241\" href=\"?note=f67456d74b418241\" title=\"58-df-linear-map\">58-df-linear-map</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e7514bc4cefba4f2\" href=\"?note=e7514bc4cefba4f2\" title=\"58-df-topology\">58-df-topology</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y\">\\(X,Y\\)</span> are complex vector spaces with designated operations <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"+_X,\\cdot_X,0_X\">\\(+_X,\\cdot_X,0_X\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"+_Y,\\cdot_Y,0_Y\">\\(+_Y,\\cdot_Y,0_Y\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B:X\\times Y\\to\\mathbb C\">\\(B:X\\times Y\\to\\mathbb C\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DualPairing}_{\\mathbb C}(X,Y,B,+_X,\\cdot_X,+_Y,\\cdot_Y)\">\\(\\mathrm{DualPairing}_{\\mathbb C}(X,Y,B,+_X,\\cdot_X,+_Y,\\cdot_Y)\\)</span> is the fully explicit dual-pairing predicate from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"2a91ae6809cec03c\" href=\"?note=2a91ae6809cec03c\" title=\"58-df-dual-pairing\">58-df-dual-pairing</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat y_B\\coloneqq\\{\\langle x,B(\\langle x,y\\rangle)\\rangle:x\\in X\\}\\in\\mathbb C^X\">\\(\\widehat y_B\\coloneqq\\{\\langle x,B(\\langle x,y\\rangle)\\rangle:x\\in X\\}\\in\\mathbb C^X\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat x_B\\coloneqq\\{\\langle y,B(\\langle x,y\\rangle)\\rangle:y\\in Y\\}\\in\\mathbb C^Y\">\\(\\widehat x_B\\coloneqq\\{\\langle y,B(\\langle x,y\\rangle)\\rangle:y\\in Y\\}\\in\\mathbb C^Y\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y_B\\coloneqq\\{\\widehat y_B:y\\in Y\\}\\subseteq\\mathbb C^X\">\\(Y_B\\coloneqq\\{\\widehat y_B:y\\in Y\\}\\subseteq\\mathbb C^X\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_B\\coloneqq\\{\\widehat x_B:x\\in X\\}\\subseteq\\mathbb C^Y\">\\(X_B\\coloneqq\\{\\widehat x_B:x\\in X\\}\\subseteq\\mathbb C^Y\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B^\\dagger(\\langle y,x\\rangle)\\coloneqq B(\\langle x,y\\rangle)\">\\(B^\\dagger(\\langle y,x\\rangle)\\coloneqq B(\\langle x,y\\rangle)\\)</span> is the transposed pairing.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{\\mathbb C}\">\\(\\tau_{\\mathbb C}\\)</span> is the usual topology on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb C\">\\(\\mathbb C\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Top}\">\\(\\mathrm{Top}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Continuous}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Continuous}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Linear}_{\\mathbb C}\">\\(\\mathrm{Linear}_{\\mathbb C}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcAnalysis2LocallyConvexSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcAnalysis2LocallyConvexSpace}_S\\)</span> are the predicates from the dependencies.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WeakDualTopology}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{WeakDualTopology}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CompactSubset}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{CompactSubset}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AbsolutelyConvex}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{AbsolutelyConvex}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RepresentedDual}_B\">\\(\\mathrm{RepresentedDual}_B\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CompatibleLCTopology}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{CompatibleLCTopology}_S\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MackeyTopology}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{MackeyTopology}_S\\)</span> are predicates defined here.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}mackey\\text{-}weak\\text{-}dual\\text{-}topology}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{WeakDualTopology}_S(\\sigma,X,Y,B,+_X,\\cdot_X,+_Y,\\cdot_Y)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{DualPairing}_{\\mathbb C}(X,Y,B,+_X,\\cdot_X,+_Y,\\cdot_Y)\\land\\mathrm{Top}(\\sigma,X)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall y\\in Y\\;\\forall O\\in\\tau_{\\mathbb C}\\;(\\widehat y_B^{-1}[O]\\in\\sigma)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall\\rho\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Top}(\\rho,X)\\land\\forall y\\in Y\\;\\forall O\\in\\tau_{\\mathbb C}\\;(\\widehat y_B^{-1}[O]\\in\\rho)\\to\\sigma\\subseteq\\rho\\right)\n\\end{aligned}\\right]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}mackey\\text{-}weak\\text{-}dual\\text{-}topology}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{WeakDualTopology}_S(\\sigma,X,Y,B,+_X,\\cdot_X,+_Y,\\cdot_Y)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{DualPairing}_{\\mathbb C}(X,Y,B,+_X,\\cdot_X,+_Y,\\cdot_Y)\\land\\mathrm{Top}(\\sigma,X)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall y\\in Y\\;\\forall O\\in\\tau_{\\mathbb C}\\;(\\widehat y_B^{-1}[O]\\in\\sigma)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall\\rho\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Top}(\\rho,X)\\land\\forall y\\in Y\\;\\forall O\\in\\tau_{\\mathbb C}\\;(\\widehat y_B^{-1}[O]\\in\\rho)\\to\\sigma\\subseteq\\rho\\right)\n\\end{aligned}\\right]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}mackey\\text{-}compact\\text{-}subset}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CompactSubset}_S(K,Y,\\sigma)\\leftrightarrow K\\subseteq Y\\land\\mathrm{Top}(\\sigma,Y)\\land\n\\forall\\mathcal U\\subseteq\\sigma\\;\\left(K\\subseteq\\bigcup\\mathcal U\\to\\exists\\mathcal F\\in[\\mathcal U]^{&lt;\\omega}\\;K\\subseteq\\bigcup\\mathcal F\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}mackey\\text{-}compact\\text{-}subset}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CompactSubset}_S(K,Y,\\sigma)\\leftrightarrow K\\subseteq Y\\land\\mathrm{Top}(\\sigma,Y)\\land\n\\forall\\mathcal U\\subseteq\\sigma\\;\\left(K\\subseteq\\bigcup\\mathcal U\\to\\exists\\mathcal F\\in[\\mathcal U]^{&lt;\\omega}\\;K\\subseteq\\bigcup\\mathcal F\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}mackey\\text{-}absolutely\\text{-}convex}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{AbsolutelyConvex}_S(K,Y,+_Y,\\cdot_Y)\\leftrightarrow \\varnothing\\neq K\\subseteq Y\\land\n\\forall y,z\\in K\\;\\forall a,b\\in\\mathbb C\\;\\left(|a|+|b|\\leq1\\to (a\\cdot_Y y)+_Y(b\\cdot_Y z)\\in K\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}mackey\\text{-}absolutely\\text{-}convex}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{AbsolutelyConvex}_S(K,Y,+_Y,\\cdot_Y)\\leftrightarrow \\varnothing\\neq K\\subseteq Y\\land\n\\forall y,z\\in K\\;\\forall a,b\\in\\mathbb C\\;\\left(|a|+|b|\\leq1\\to (a\\cdot_Y y)+_Y(b\\cdot_Y z)\\in K\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}mackey\\text{-}represented\\text{-}dual}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RepresentedDual}_B(Y_B,X,Y,B)\\leftrightarrow\nY_B=\\{\\,\\widehat y_B\\in\\mathbb C^X:y\\in Y\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;(\\widehat y_B(x)=B(\\langle x,y\\rangle))\\,\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}mackey\\text{-}represented\\text{-}dual}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RepresentedDual}_B(Y_B,X,Y,B)\\leftrightarrow\nY_B=\\{\\,\\widehat y_B\\in\\mathbb C^X:y\\in Y\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;(\\widehat y_B(x)=B(\\langle x,y\\rangle))\\,\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}mackey\\text{-}continuous\\text{-}dual}\\vdash\nX&#39;_\\tau\\coloneqq\\{\\ell\\in\\mathbb C^X:\\mathrm{Linear}_{\\mathbb C}(\\ell;X,\\mathbb C)\\land\n\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(\\ell,X,\\tau,\\mathbb C,\\tau_{\\mathbb C})\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}mackey\\text{-}continuous\\text{-}dual}\\vdash\nX&#39;_\\tau\\coloneqq\\{\\ell\\in\\mathbb C^X:\\mathrm{Linear}_{\\mathbb C}(\\ell;X,\\mathbb C)\\land\n\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(\\ell,X,\\tau,\\mathbb C,\\tau_{\\mathbb C})\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}mackey\\text{-}compatible}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CompatibleLCTopology}_S(\\tau,X,Y,B,+_X,\\cdot_X,0_X,+_Y,\\cdot_Y)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{DualPairing}_{\\mathbb C}(X,Y,B,+_X,\\cdot_X,+_Y,\\cdot_Y)\\land\n\\exists\\mathcal P\\;\\mathrm{ZfcAnalysis2LocallyConvexSpace}_S(X,\\tau,\\mathcal P,\\mathbb C,+_X,\\cdot_X,0_X)\\land X&#39;_\\tau=Y_B\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}mackey\\text{-}compatible}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CompatibleLCTopology}_S(\\tau,X,Y,B,+_X,\\cdot_X,0_X,+_Y,\\cdot_Y)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{DualPairing}_{\\mathbb C}(X,Y,B,+_X,\\cdot_X,+_Y,\\cdot_Y)\\land\n\\exists\\mathcal P\\;\\mathrm{ZfcAnalysis2LocallyConvexSpace}_S(X,\\tau,\\mathcal P,\\mathbb C,+_X,\\cdot_X,0_X)\\land X&#39;_\\tau=Y_B\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}mackey\\text{-}compacta}\\vdash\n\\mathcal K_B\\coloneqq\\left\\{K\\subseteq Y:\\exists\\sigma_{Y,X}\\;\\left(\\mathrm{WeakDualTopology}_S(\\sigma_{Y,X},Y,X,B^\\dagger,+_Y,\\cdot_Y,+_X,\\cdot_X)\\land\n\\mathrm{CompactSubset}_S(K,Y,\\sigma_{Y,X})\\land\\mathrm{AbsolutelyConvex}_S(K,Y,+_Y,\\cdot_Y)\\right)\\right\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}mackey\\text{-}compacta}\\vdash\n\\mathcal K_B\\coloneqq\\left\\{K\\subseteq Y:\\exists\\sigma_{Y,X}\\;\\left(\\mathrm{WeakDualTopology}_S(\\sigma_{Y,X},Y,X,B^\\dagger,+_Y,\\cdot_Y,+_X,\\cdot_X)\\land\n\\mathrm{CompactSubset}_S(K,Y,\\sigma_{Y,X})\\land\\mathrm{AbsolutelyConvex}_S(K,Y,+_Y,\\cdot_Y)\\right)\\right\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}mackey\\text{-}seminorms}\\vdash\n\\mathcal P_B\\coloneqq\\left\\{p\\in(\\mathbb R_{\\geq0})^X:\\exists K\\in\\mathcal K_B\\;\\forall x\\in X\\;\np(x)=\\sup\\{\\,|B(\\langle x,y\\rangle)|:y\\in K\\,\\}\\right\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}mackey\\text{-}seminorms}\\vdash\n\\mathcal P_B\\coloneqq\\left\\{p\\in(\\mathbb R_{\\geq0})^X:\\exists K\\in\\mathcal K_B\\;\\forall x\\in X\\;\np(x)=\\sup\\{\\,|B(\\langle x,y\\rangle)|:y\\in K\\,\\}\\right\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}mackey\\text{-}topology}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{MackeyTopology}_S(\\mu,X,Y,B,+_X,\\cdot_X,0_X,+_Y,\\cdot_Y)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{DualPairing}_{\\mathbb C}(X,Y,B,+_X,\\cdot_X,+_Y,\\cdot_Y)\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcAnalysis2LocallyConvexSpace}_S(X,\\mu,\\mathcal P_B,\\mathbb C,+_X,\\cdot_X,0_X)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}mackey\\text{-}topology}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{MackeyTopology}_S(\\mu,X,Y,B,+_X,\\cdot_X,0_X,+_Y,\\cdot_Y)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{DualPairing}_{\\mathbb C}(X,Y,B,+_X,\\cdot_X,+_Y,\\cdot_Y)\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcAnalysis2LocallyConvexSpace}_S(X,\\mu,\\mathcal P_B,\\mathbb C,+_X,\\cdot_X,0_X)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The transposed pairing <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B^\\dagger\">\\(B^\\dagger\\)</span> makes the weak topology on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y\">\\(Y\\)</span> generated by the represented copy <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_B\">\\(X_B\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>The family <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P_B\">\\(\\mathcal P_B\\)</span> consists exactly of uniform-convergence seminorms on absolutely convex <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma(Y,X)\">\\(\\sigma(Y,X)\\)</span>-compact subsets.</li>\n<li>The operations on both vector-space carriers are explicit predicate arguments; nonempty compacta avoid the undefined supremum of the empty set in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P_B\">\\(\\mathcal P_B\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Compatibility means equality of the continuous dual with the represented copy <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y_B\">\\(Y_B\\)</span>, not an untyped equality with the carrier <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y\">\\(Y\\)</span> itself.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-dual-pairing","status":"resolved","id":"2a91ae6809cec03c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-dual-pairing]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-analysis2-locally-convex-space","status":"resolved","id":"7d71608bc30daeda","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-analysis2-locally-convex-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-continuous-map","status":"resolved","id":"3cd1834de4f2efb2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-continuous-map]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-linear-map","status":"resolved","id":"f67456d74b418241","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-linear-map]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-topology","status":"resolved","id":"e7514bc4cefba4f2","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-topology]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-dual-pairing","status":"resolved","id":"2a91ae6809cec03c","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$B:X\\times Y\\to\\mathbb C$ and $\\mathrm{DualPairing}_{\\mathbb C}(X,Y,B,+_X,\\cdot_X,+_Y,\\cdot_Y)$ is the fully explicit dual-pairing predicate from [[58-df-dual-pairing]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,Y","display":false},{"tex":"+_X,\\cdot_X,0_X","display":false},{"tex":"+_Y,\\cdot_Y,0_Y","display":false},{"tex":"B:X\\times Y\\to\\mathbb C","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DualPairing}_{\\mathbb C}(X,Y,B,+_X,\\cdot_X,+_Y,\\cdot_Y)","display":false},{"tex":"\\widehat y_B\\coloneqq\\{\\langle x,B(\\langle x,y\\rangle)\\rangle:x\\in X\\}\\in\\mathbb C^X","display":false},{"tex":"\\widehat x_B\\coloneqq\\{\\langle y,B(\\langle x,y\\rangle)\\rangle:y\\in Y\\}\\in\\mathbb C^Y","display":false},{"tex":"Y_B\\coloneqq\\{\\widehat y_B:y\\in Y\\}\\subseteq\\mathbb C^X","display":false},{"tex":"X_B\\coloneqq\\{\\widehat x_B:x\\in X\\}\\subseteq\\mathbb C^Y","display":false},{"tex":"B^\\dagger(\\langle y,x\\rangle)\\coloneqq B(\\langle x,y\\rangle)","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_{\\mathbb C}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb C","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Top}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Continuous}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Linear}_{\\mathbb C}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcAnalysis2LocallyConvexSpace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{WeakDualTopology}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CompactSubset}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AbsolutelyConvex}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RepresentedDual}_B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CompatibleLCTopology}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MackeyTopology}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}mackey\\text{-}weak\\text{-}dual\\text{-}topology}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{WeakDualTopology}_S(\\sigma,X,Y,B,+_X,\\cdot_X,+_Y,\\cdot_Y)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left[\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{DualPairing}_{\\mathbb C}(X,Y,B,+_X,\\cdot_X,+_Y,\\cdot_Y)\\land\\mathrm{Top}(\\sigma,X)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall y\\in Y\\;\\forall O\\in\\tau_{\\mathbb C}\\;(\\widehat y_B^{-1}[O]\\in\\sigma)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall\\rho\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Top}(\\rho,X)\\land\\forall y\\in Y\\;\\forall O\\in\\tau_{\\mathbb C}\\;(\\widehat y_B^{-1}[O]\\in\\rho)\\to\\sigma\\subseteq\\rho\\right)\n\\end{aligned}\\right]","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}mackey\\text{-}compact\\text{-}subset}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CompactSubset}_S(K,Y,\\sigma)\\leftrightarrow K\\subseteq Y\\land\\mathrm{Top}(\\sigma,Y)\\land\n\\forall\\mathcal U\\subseteq\\sigma\\;\\left(K\\subseteq\\bigcup\\mathcal U\\to\\exists\\mathcal F\\in[\\mathcal U]^{<\\omega}\\;K\\subseteq\\bigcup\\mathcal F\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}mackey\\text{-}absolutely\\text{-}convex}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{AbsolutelyConvex}_S(K,Y,+_Y,\\cdot_Y)\\leftrightarrow \\varnothing\\neq K\\subseteq Y\\land\n\\forall y,z\\in K\\;\\forall a,b\\in\\mathbb C\\;\\left(|a|+|b|\\leq1\\to (a\\cdot_Y y)+_Y(b\\cdot_Y z)\\in K\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}mackey\\text{-}represented\\text{-}dual}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RepresentedDual}_B(Y_B,X,Y,B)\\leftrightarrow\nY_B=\\{\\,\\widehat y_B\\in\\mathbb C^X:y\\in Y\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;(\\widehat y_B(x)=B(\\langle x,y\\rangle))\\,\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}mackey\\text{-}continuous\\text{-}dual}\\vdash\nX'_\\tau\\coloneqq\\{\\ell\\in\\mathbb C^X:\\mathrm{Linear}_{\\mathbb C}(\\ell;X,\\mathbb C)\\land\n\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(\\ell,X,\\tau,\\mathbb C,\\tau_{\\mathbb C})\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}mackey\\text{-}compatible}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CompatibleLCTopology}_S(\\tau,X,Y,B,+_X,\\cdot_X,0_X,+_Y,\\cdot_Y)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{DualPairing}_{\\mathbb C}(X,Y,B,+_X,\\cdot_X,+_Y,\\cdot_Y)\\land\n\\exists\\mathcal P\\;\\mathrm{ZfcAnalysis2LocallyConvexSpace}_S(X,\\tau,\\mathcal P,\\mathbb C,+_X,\\cdot_X,0_X)\\land X'_\\tau=Y_B","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}mackey\\text{-}compacta}\\vdash\n\\mathcal K_B\\coloneqq\\left\\{K\\subseteq Y:\\exists\\sigma_{Y,X}\\;\\left(\\mathrm{WeakDualTopology}_S(\\sigma_{Y,X},Y,X,B^\\dagger,+_Y,\\cdot_Y,+_X,\\cdot_X)\\land\n\\mathrm{CompactSubset}_S(K,Y,\\sigma_{Y,X})\\land\\mathrm{AbsolutelyConvex}_S(K,Y,+_Y,\\cdot_Y)\\right)\\right\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}mackey\\text{-}seminorms}\\vdash\n\\mathcal P_B\\coloneqq\\left\\{p\\in(\\mathbb R_{\\geq0})^X:\\exists K\\in\\mathcal K_B\\;\\forall x\\in X\\;\np(x)=\\sup\\{\\,|B(\\langle x,y\\rangle)|:y\\in K\\,\\}\\right\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}mackey\\text{-}topology}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{MackeyTopology}_S(\\mu,X,Y,B,+_X,\\cdot_X,0_X,+_Y,\\cdot_Y)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{DualPairing}_{\\mathbb C}(X,Y,B,+_X,\\cdot_X,+_Y,\\cdot_Y)\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcAnalysis2LocallyConvexSpace}_S(X,\\mu,\\mathcal P_B,\\mathbb C,+_X,\\cdot_X,0_X)","display":true},{"tex":"B^\\dagger","display":false},{"tex":"Y","display":false},{"tex":"X_B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P_B","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma(Y,X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P_B","display":false},{"tex":"Y_B","display":false},{"tex":"Y","display":false}],"bytes":4871,"backlinks":[{"id":"c0fe5ecedfe72c4b","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{WeakDualTopology}_S$, $\\mathrm{CompatibleLCTopology}_S$, and $\\mathrm{MackeyTopology}_S$ are the predicates from [[58-df-mackey-topology]]."},{"id":"a11585cba9c21cfd","anchor":"ref-365","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[58-df-mackey-topology]]"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-807","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-mackey-topology.md|58-df-mackey-topology]]（batch15）"}],"outgoing":["2a91ae6809cec03c","7d71608bc30daeda","3cd1834de4f2efb2","f67456d74b418241","36d7463d215be751","e7514bc4cefba4f2"]}